# Screenshots of every page, and the PDF built from them (scripts/capture-app-pdf.mjs).
# These hold real athlete records — names, wellness scores, injuries — the moment
# they are captured from a signed-in session. They are a review artefact for one
# person on one machine, never a repo file. CLAUDE.md §2 rule 1 and §10.
capture/
Fydr-pages-*.pdf

# Walkthrough capture output: 142 PDFs, ~91MB, regenerated by
# scripts/capture-walkthroughs.mjs in one command per account. The report that
# accounts for them IS tracked (docs/walkthrough-screenshots/CAPTURE-REPORT.md);
# the images themselves are not, because git keeps every version and a
# re-capture would double the weight permanently.
docs/walkthrough-screenshots/*/

